    <item>
      <title>FOSDEM and KiCAD &#43; FreeCAD day 2025</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/fosdem-and-kicad-freecad-day-2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/fosdem-and-kicad-freecad-day-2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;It&amp;rsquo;s happening again! &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Fosdem&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM 2025&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; has been announced and, like the previous years, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FPA&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; are thrilled to organise once again our world-famous &lt;strong&gt;FreeCAD events&lt;/strong&gt;. These will take place in Brussels, from January 28th to February the 2nd 2025, together with FOSDEM. Be ready for several days full of coding, open-sourceness and fun!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The FreeCAD day 2024</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/the-freecad-day-2024/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/the-freecad-day-2024/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This year again, the &lt;a href=&#34;https://fpa.freecad.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FPA&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; organized a FreeCAD day and a hackathon (and &lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.freecad.org/2023/10/31/fosdem-freecad-day-and-hackathon-2024/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;much more&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;!) together with &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, in Brussels. We had an incredible, epic week of events (which you&amp;rsquo;ll know all about later on this blog). I&amp;rsquo;ll describe here briefly what happened during the hackathon and the FreeCAD day.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD, Ondsel and Prusa save FOSDEM!</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-ondsel-and-prusa-save-fosdem/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-ondsel-and-prusa-save-fosdem/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Whilst there was enough toilet paper, there was an issue in deploying it. We were approached at the FreeCAD/Ondsel, KiCad booth by a FOSDEM volunteer who was worried. The team only had one key that unlocked the toilet paper dispensers and they were struggling to keep the flow of paper steady. A crisis was emerging!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>FreeCAD at FOSDEM</title>
      <link>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;image-with-popover&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button aria-label=&#34;Zoom image&#34; popovertarget=&#34;img-001&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img srcset=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem/K_Level_One.png 500w&#34;&#xA;            sizes=&#34;75vw&#34;&#xA;            src=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem/K_Level_One.png&#34;&#xA;            width=&#34;500&#34;&#xA;            height=&#34;353&#34;&#xA;            title=&#34;FreeCAD at FOSDEM&#34;&#xA;            alt=&#34;FreeCAD at FOSDEM&#34;&#xA;            loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;            fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;FreeCAD at FOSDEM&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;div id=&#34;img-001&#34; popover&gt;&#xA;          &lt;img src=&#34;https://marcuspollio.github.io/FreeCAD-website/news/freecad-at-fosdem/K_Level_One.png&#34;&#xA;            title=&#34;FreeCAD at FOSDEM&#34;&#xA;            alt=&#34;FreeCAD at FOSDEM&#34;&#xA;            loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;            fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&gt;&#xA;          &lt;button class=&#34;close&#34;&#xA;            popovertarget=&#34;img-001&#34;&#xA;            popovertargetaction=&#34;hide&#34;&#xA;            aria-label=&#34;Close image viewer&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;icon-cross&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M4 20 20 4M4 4 20 20&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This weekend in Brussels lots of members of the FreeCAD community will be at &lt;a href=&#34;https://fosdem.org/2024/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;FOSDEM&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, the amazing free event for all things opensource. If you are attending FOSDEM please come and spend some time at the FreeCAD stand which will be in the K Building. We have some excellent neighbours, &lt;a href=&#34;https://pine64.org/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;Pine64&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.prusa3d.com/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;Prusa&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and we hope that FreeCAD sponsors &lt;a href=&#34;https://libre.space/&#34;&#xA;  class=&#34;external-link&#34;title=&#34;Open link&#34;&#xA;    target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    rel=&#34;external noreferrer noopener&#34;&gt;Libre Space Foundation&lt;span class=&#34;icon-external&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M11 7H6A2 2 0 004 9v9a2 2 0 002 2h9a2 2 0 002-2v-5&#34;/&gt;&lt;line x1=&#34;10&#34; y1=&#34;14&#34; x2=&#34;20&#34; y2=&#34;4&#34;/&gt;&lt;polyline points=&#34;15 4 20 4 20 9&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; should also have a presence in this space.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
